{"id":"vod_sn_35813","vodId":"35813","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"鲁邦三世 PART6","name_cn":"鲁邦三世 PART6","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/91be1478e0bad614d0c0d04b1238e3eb.jpg"},"summary":"近日，Sugoi LITE（twi：SugoiLITE）在外国媒体上爆料，今年为庆祝鲁邦三世50周年纪念，「鲁邦三世 PART6」决定制作TV动画，并公布了一张海报。不过，目前官方尚未回应。「鲁邦三世」是日本漫画家Monkey Punch（モンキー．パンチ，本名加藤一彦）的漫画系列作品，1967年8月10日在双叶社「周刊漫画Action」创刊号上开始连载，1971年TV动画初登荧屏，至今已超过40年并仍在放送中，一直保持极高的人气，是日本动漫界名副其实的不死鸟，被誉为日本国民级动漫。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2kxBjRcy161/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u9p8fWme7L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zgDc2RhcW11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/D5bepLfiQC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eDgKRTx2RK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hsYe8W3gNw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/010AMBMaTa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iJYtizw6wg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cuPHWcZSxg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YEDaJWUDrH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gcXP4jUeHK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tdEsF4LLjy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rP9GJmrDDv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EQmq5nvyx11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202